(j)
Plan for Training/Seminars/Workshops to increase consumer awareness.

20.
The Distribution Licensee shall prepare a detailed Programme Completion Report and submit the same to the
Commission within three months of completion of such programme;

22.
The Commission shall consider to provide appropriate tariff interventions to support DSM, viz. extending Time of day
metering up to LT services, load management, rebate for energy efficient buildings / appliances etc.;

26.
The Commission may, from time to time, issue orders and practice directions in regard to the implementation of the
regulations and procedures to be followed;
